OL,3,GNEWSABridge safe for another 50 years,
OL,4,Acouncillors told
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe discussion was sparked by whether
OL,7,Fthe council had learned lessons from
OL,8,Fthe recent demolition of the A167
OL,9,Fflyover and how decommissioning
OL,10,Fsimilarly large pieces of
OL,11,Finfrastructure would work.
OL,13,FGateshead Council closed the flyover in
OL,14,FDecember 2024, after inspections raised
OL,15,Fconcerns over a potential collapse.
